-height:1.3;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\">探险与属性说明</div><div class=\"wf-t wf-el\" style=\"left:40px;top:280px;width:295px;height:314px;color:#5F5B53;font-size:12px;font-weight:500;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:flex-start;text-align:left;line-height:1.45;overflow:hidden;padding-right:2px;\">1. 每天7:00所有精灵需点击1次&quot;开始探险&quot;才自动消耗能量探险；<br>2. 能量主要通过“任务”里做任务获得，养成中的精灵自动扣除能量进行探险，每次扣5点能量。每晚的23:00-7:00期间不能探险，要好好休息哦；<br>3. 探险可以获得钻石和装扮物掉落，钻石可以抽奖获得精灵或碎片，装扮掉落可以激活互动壁纸、照片和纪念品，探险还可以获得额外的钻石奖励，获得额外的钻石奖励时精灵播放抱钻石动画，点击精灵可领取；<br>4. 体力、心情、健康=0时精灵处于异常状态，影响探险的效率，生病会停止探险；<br>5. 领取每日宝箱获取投喂材料，成功投喂有钻石奖励，钻石数量=（实际增加的饥饿、心情和健康值）/10；<br>6. 非月卡状态下钻石堆叠上限是300个，月卡状态下根据月卡等级钻石堆叠上限最高1000个；<br>7. 月卡可以加速探险（快速掉落钻石和装扮物）。</div></div><div class=\"wf-modal\" id=\"wf-modal-1569\"><div class=\"wf-modal-dismiss\" data-action=\"close\"></div><div class=\"wf-card wf-el\" style=\"left:31px;top:133px;width:313px;height:618px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.92);border-radius:16px;box-shadow:0 4px 16px -2px rgba(0,0,0,0.06), 0 2px 6px -1px rgba(0,0,0,0.04), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.85);border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.05);box-sizing:border-box;\"></div><div class=\"wf-img wf-el\" style=\"left:45px;top:163px;width:26px;height:18px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.65);border:1px dashed rgba(201,155,107,0.55);border-radius:6px;box-sizing:border-box;\"></div><div class=\"wf-img wf-el\" style=\"left:56px;top:253px;width:209px;height:78px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.65);border:1px dashed rgba(201,155,107,0.55);border-radius:10px;box-sizing:border-box;\"></div><div class=\"wf-ic wf-el\" style=\"left:153px;top:683px;width:70px;height:7px;background:#F3F4F6;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;border-radius:8px;box-shadow:inset 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;box-sizing:border-box;\"><i class=\'wf-ic-glyph\' style=\'width:36%;height:36%;background:rgba(156,163,175,0.50);border-radius:2px;display:inline-