;font-weight:400;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;line-height:1.3;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\">心情值</div><div class=\"wf-t wf-el\" style=\"left:64px;top:566px;width:27px;height:16px;color:#4B5563;font-size:11px;font-weight:400;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;line-height:1.3;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\">+10</div><div class=\"wf-t wf-el\" style=\"left:147px;top:566px;width:27px;height:16px;color:#4B5563;font-size:11px;font-weight:400;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;line-height:1.3;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\">+10</div><div class=\"wf-t wf-el\" style=\"left:32px;top:603px;width:65px;height:15px;color:#191919;font-size:10px;font-weight:400;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;line-height:1.3;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\">护目镜道具</div><div class=\"wf-t wf-el\" style=\"left:120px;top:603px;width:51px;height:15px;color:#191919;font-size:10px;font-weight:400;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;line-height:1.3;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\">衣服道具</div><div class=\"wf-t wf-el\" style=\"left:25px;top:663px;width:63px;height:16px;color:#191919;font-size:11px;font-weight:400;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;line-height:1.3;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\">特殊道具</div><div class=\"wf-t wf-el\" style=\"left:64px;top:744px;width:27px;height:16px;color:#4B5563;font-size:11px;font-weight:400;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;line-height:1.3;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\">+10</div><div class=\"wf-t wf-el\" style=\"left:147px;top:744px;width:27px;height:16px;color:#4B5563;font-size:11px;font-weight:400;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;line-height:1.3;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\">+10</div><div class=\"wf-t wf-el\" style=\"left:231px;top:744px;width:27px;height:16px;color:#4B5563;font-size:11px;font-weight:400;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;line-height:1.3;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\">+10</div><div class=\"wf-t wf-el\" style=\"left:37px;top:779px;width:51px;height:15px;color:#191919;font-size:10px;font-weight:400;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;line-height:1.3;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\">玩偶道具</div><div class=\"wf-t wf-el\" style=\"left:115px;top:779px;width:65px;height:15px;color:#191919;font-size:10px;font-weight:400;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;line-height:1.3;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\">游戏机道具</div><div class=\"wf-t wf-el\" style=\"left:204px;top:779px;width:51px;height:15px;color:#191919;font-size:10px;font-weight:400;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;line-height:1.3;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\">电子道具</div><div class=\"wf-modal\" id=\"wf-modal-1574\"><div class=\"wf-modal-dismiss\" data-action=\"close\"></div><div class=\"wf-card wf-modal-panel wf-el\" style=\"left:20px;top:210px;width:335px;height:458px;background:#FFFDF8;border-radius:24px;box-shadow:0 12px 36px rgba(0,0,0,0.22);box-sizing:border-box;\"></div><div class=\"wf-btn wf-act wf-el\" data-action=\"back\" style=\"left:40px;top:608px;width:295px;height:40px;background:linear-gradient(180deg, #D7D2C8 0%, #C1BCB1 100%);border-radius:10px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:0 2px;overflow:hidden;\"><span class=\'wf-btn-label\' style=\'color:#333333;font-size:14px;white-space:nowrap;line-height:1;\'>知道了</span></div><div class=\"wf-t wf-el\" style=\"left:42px;top:245px;width:153px;height:24px;color:#161615;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;line-height:1.3;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\">探险与属性说明</div><div class=\"wf-t wf-el\" style=\"left:40px;top:280px;width:295px;height:314px;color:#5F5B53;font-size:12px;font-weight:500;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:flex-start;text-align:left;line-height:1.45;overflow:hidden;padding-right:2px;\">1. 每天7:00所有精灵需点击1次&quot;开始探险&quot;才自动消耗能量探险；<br>2. 能量主要通过“任务”里做任务获得，养成中的精灵自动扣除能量进行探险，每次扣5点能量。每晚的23:00-7:00期间不能探险，要好好休息哦；<br>3. 探险可以获得钻石和装扮物掉落，钻石可以抽奖获得精灵或碎片，装扮掉落可以激活互动壁纸、照片和纪念品，探险还可以获得额外的钻石奖励，获得额外的钻石奖励时精灵播放抱钻石动画，点击精灵可领取；<br>4. 体力、心情、健康=0时精灵处于异常状态，影响探险的效率，生病会停止探险；<br>5. 领取每日宝箱获取投喂材料，成功投喂有钻石奖励，钻石数量=（实际增加的饥饿、心情和健康值）/10；<br>6. 非月卡状态下钻石堆叠上限是300个，月卡状态下根据月卡等级钻石堆叠上限最高1000个；<br>7. 月卡可以加速探险（快速掉落钻石和装扮物）。</div></div><div class=\"wf-modal\" id=\"wf-modal-1580\"><div class=\"wf-modal-dismiss\" data-action=\"close\"></div><div class=\"wf-card wf-el\" style=\"left:16px;top:549px;width:342px;height:268px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.92);border-radius:16px;box-shadow:0 4px 16px -2px rgba(0,0,0,0.06), 0 2px 6px -1px rgba(0,0,0,0.04), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.85);border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.05);box-sizing:border-box;\"></div><div class=\"wf-img wf-el\" style=\"left:150px;top:549px;width:76px;height:76px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.65);border:1px dashed rgba(201,155,107,0.55);border-radius:6px;box-sizing:border-box;\"></div><div class=\"wf-badge wf-el\" style=\"left:144px;top:660px;width:30px;height:14px;background:#F8782F;color:#fff;border-radius:999px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;padding:1px 6px;box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(220,38,38,0.28), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.35);font-size:9px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.25);\">限量</div><div class=\"wf-badge wf-el\" style=\"left:180px;top:660px;width:50px;height:14px;background:#F8782F;color:#fff;border-radius:999px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;padding:1px 6px;box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(220,38,38,0.28), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.35);font-size:9px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.25);\">奶龙专属</div><div class=\"wf-btn wf-act wf-el\" data-action=\"back\" style=\"left:37px;top:750px;width:144px;height:45px;background:linear-gradient(180deg, #E3DEDF 0%, #CDC9C9 100%);border-radius:11px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:0 2px;overflow:hidden;\"><span class=\'wf-btn-label\' style=\'color:#333333;font-size:14px;white-space:nowrap;line-height:1;\'>取消</span></div><div class=\"wf-btn wf-el\" style=\"left:194px;top:750px;width:144px;height:45px;background:linear-gradient(180deg, #F98848 0%, #E46E2B 100%);border-radius:11px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:0 2px;overflow:hidden;\"><span class=\'wf-btn-label\' style=\'color:#FFFFFF;font-size:14px;white-space:nowrap;line-height:1;\'>8 钻石购买</span></div><div class=\"wf-t wf-el\" style=\"left:150px;top:638px;width:74px;height:19px;color:#171717;font-size:13px;font-weight:500;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;line-height:1.3;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\">护目镜道具</div><div class=\"wf-t wf-el\" style=\"left:42px;top:693px;width:292px;height:38px;color:#534F51;font-size:13px;font-weight:500;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;text-align:left;line-height:1.45;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;\">道具不足，是否使用 8 钻石购买一个护目镜道具?</div></div></body></html>\n'),(1582,84,'资源详情页','designs/资源详情页.png',375,833,NULL,NULL,27,1,'2026-09-14 12:00:52','<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\"><head><meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>资源详情页</title>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  html,body{margin:0;padding:0}\n  body{width:375px;height:833px;position:relative;background:linear-gradient(180deg, #818183 0%, #727274 100%);overflow:hidden;\n       font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"PingFang SC\",\"Helvetica Neue\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;\n       -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;}\n  .wf-el{position:absolute;box-sizing:border-box}\n  /* 系统性 z-index 层次体系（严格按视觉层级分层，彻底解决遮挡问题） */\n  .wf-fx{z-index:2}\n  .wf-card{z-index:10;border-radius:16px;box-shadow:0 4px 16px -2px rgba(0,0,0,0.06), 0 2px 6px -1px rgba(0,0,0,0.04);border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.05);overflow:hidden}\n  .wf-img{z-index:15}\n  .wf-avatar{z-index:16}\n  .wf-div{z-index:20}\n  .wf-ic{z-index:22;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;box-sizing:border-box}\n  .wf-t{z-index:25;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;max-width:100%;line-height:1.25}\n  .wf-skeleton-bar{z-index:25;background:#E5E7EB;border-radius:8px}\n  .wf-btn,.wf-sw,.wf-ck,.wf-search,.wf-tabs,.wf-rate,.wf-progress{z-index:30}\n  .wf-btn{cursor:pointer;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.25);box-shadow:0 3px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.12), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.35);transition:transform 0.1s ease, filter 0.15s ease}\n  .wf-btn:hover{filter:brightness(1.05);box-shadow:0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.16), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.45)}\n  .wf-btn:active{transform:scale(0.97);filter:brightness(0.95)}\n  .wf-btn-label{color:#FFF;font-weight:600;font-size:15px;white-space:nowrap;\n       overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;max-width:100%;letter-spacing:-0.2px;text-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.20)}\n  .wf-act,.wf-ic[data-nav],.wf-img[data-nav],.wf-card[data-nav]{cursor:pointer}\n  .wf-badge,.wf-side-pill{z-index:35}\n  .wf-navbar{z-index:45}\n  .wf-segs{display:flex;width:100%;height:100%;box-sizing:border-box}\n  .wf-segs span{flex:1;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\n       font-size:13px;color:#6B7280;border-radius:8px;min-width:0;\n       white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden}\n  .wf-segs span.on{background:var(--seg-bg, #FFF);color:var(--seg-ink, #ff9800);box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.12);font-weight:600}\n  .wf-sw{display:block;cursor:pointer;transition:all 0.2s ease}\n  .wf-sw-k{transition:all 0.22s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1)}\n  .wf-ck{cursor:pointer;transition:opacity 0.15s ease}\n  .wf-ck:active{opacity:0.8}\n  .wf-rate{user-select:none}\n  .wf-progress{box-sizing:border-box}\n  .wf-search-in{font-size:14px;user-select:none}\n  .wf-modal{position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:999;display:none;background:rgba(15,18,26,.55);backdrop-filter:blur(6px);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(6px)}\n  .wf-modal.wf-show{display:block}\n  .wf-modal-dismiss{position:absolute;inset:0;background:none;border:none;padding:0;margin:0;cursor:pointer}\n  .wf-tabbar{display:flex;z-index:50;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.94);backdrop-filter:blur(16px);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(16px);box-shadow:0 -2px 10px rgba(0,0,0,.05);border-top:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.04)}\n  .wf-tabit{position:absolute;top:0;height:100%;display:flex;flex-direction:column;\n       align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:3px;cursor:pointer;min-width:0}\n  .wf-tabic{width:22px;height:22px;border-radius:6px;background:rgba(176,141,110,.25);\n       border:1px dashed rgba(201,155,107,0.4)}\n  .wf-tabit span{font-size:10px;color:rgba(107,68,35,.75);max-width:92%;white-space:nowrap;\n       overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}\n  .wf-tabit.on .wf-tabic{background:#ff9800}\n  .wf-tabit.on span{color:#ff9800;font-weight:bold}\n</style></head>\n<body data-wf-canvas=\"375x833\"><div class=\"wf-card wf-bottom-sheet wf-el\" style=\"left:0px;top:250px;width:375px;height:583px;background:#FFFFFF;border-radius:32px 32px 0 0;box-shadow:0 -8px 32px rgba(0,0,0,0.18);box-sizing:border-box;\"></div><div class=\"wf-div wf-el\" style=\"left:80px;top:393px;width:252px;height:2px;background:linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(0,0,0,0.08) 20%, rgba(0,0,0,0.08) 80%, transparent);border-radius:1px;\"></div><div class=\"wf-div wf-el\" style=\"left:80px;top:455px;width:252px;height:2px;background: